WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.497
ALEX: That's the right qualifier.
Reuters sourced this from people with
knowledge of

00:00:03.497 --> 00:00:06.993
ALEX: the matter — not a press release.
So the numbers are reported,

00:00:06.993 --> 00:00:10.490
ALEX: not confirmed by ByteDance
directly.

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:14.479
RUFUS: Which doesn't make them wrong. It
makes them the most credible available

00:00:14.479 --> 00:00:18.368
RUFUS: reporting. The two-hundred-and-
ninety-million figure and the one-point-
five billion valuation are what we

00:00:18.368 --> 00:00:22.257
RUFUS: have.

00:00:22.357 --> 00:00:26.632
JAMIE: My question is who's in that two-
hundred-and-ninety million. Because
biotech AI investment

00:00:26.632 --> 00:00:30.908
JAMIE: has attracted a mix of genuinely
long-horizon investors and people
chasing the

00:00:30.908 --> 00:00:35.183
JAMIE: category regardless of the
underlying science.
